2026-03-30 10:20:42,720 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-14b1aaf0-b337-4a3b-96c3-02e046afcbc4', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://cset.georgetown.edu/careers/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="main" id="main" role="main" tabindex="-1">\n<div class="l-preface">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Provided by templates/page.twig -->\n<div class="page-title">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n<div class="page-title__inner">\n<h1 class="page-title__title">Careers</h1>\n              CSET researchers and staff members are challenged with meaningful work, pursue ongoing professional development and learning, and contribute to a collegial and engaging environment where they can thrive. We are committed to fostering a culture of inclusion and encourage individuals with diverse backgrounds and experiences to apply. We especially encourage applications from women, people of color, and individuals with disabilities who are excited about contributing to our mission.\n                      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="l-constrain--small post-content">\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img alt="" class="wp-image-23446" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-97.png 720w" width="700"/></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-43d68648-f0dd-421b-981d-0f1116d81e1a"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/content-and-digital-communications-lead/">Content and Digital Communications Lead</a></h4>\n<p><em>The application deadline for this role has passed. Those moving forward in the process will be contacted directly. </em></p>\n<hr/>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading" id="block-43d68648-f0dd-421b-981d-0f1116d81e1a"></h4>\n<hr/>\n<hr/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-15929" decoding="async" height="900" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities.png 1600w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Student-Opportunities-350x197.png 350w" style="width:700px;height:auto" width="1600"/></a></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/georgetown-student-opportunities/"><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6">Georgetown Student Opportunities</span></a><span class="tadv-color" style="color:#003da6"> </span></h4>\n<p>CSET is hiring for the following student positions: China Emerging Tech Student Research Assistant – <a href="https://www.myworkday.com/georgetown/d/inst/15$158872/9925$42364.htmld">JR24213</a>.  All applications for student employment must be submitted via GMS. More information can be found on our\xa0Student Opportunities<a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp/wp-admin/post.php?post=6329&amp;action=edit"> page</a>.</p>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Culture Statement</h3>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized" id="Culture-Statement"><a href="#Culture-Statement"><img alt="" class="wp-image-17006" decoding="async" height="3300" sizes="(max-width: 2550px) 100vw, 2550px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET.png 2550w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-250x324.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-700x906.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-768x994.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1187x1536.png 1187w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-1583x2048.png 1583w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-120x155.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-116x150.png 116w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/Culture-Statement-CSET-270x350.png 270w" style="width:1078px;height:auto" width="2550"/></a></figure>\n<hr/>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Resources</span> </h3>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">FAQ’s:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nD6Y9mytlMJBvfIDUZI45NtwQ3ASC14WzfJqZTEDcqg/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P6mGbiNs7OihHHS1Y7i2_sHgPmZch_L_wdMy0o6rqeo/edit#heading=h.nisttvk8h58n">Research Fellow FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading">Previous hiring info session recordings:</h5>\n<ul class="wp-block-list">\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-hiring-info-session/">Research Analyst/Data Research Analyst Hiring Info Session</a> (2/10/22)</li>\n<li><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/event/cset-research-fellow-hiring-info-session/">Research Fellow Hiring Info Session</a> (8/4/22)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><span class="underline" style="text-decoration: underline">Contact Us</span> </h3>\n<p>For all inquiries related to current job openings, please contact us at <a href="mailto:csetcareers@georgetown.edu">csetcareers@georgetown.edu</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class="l-postscript">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
