led-1920x1080.jpg" srcset="https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-300x169.jpg 300w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-768x432.jpg 768w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-680x383.jpg 680w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-480x270.jpg 480w, https://cfg.eu/wp-content/uploads/Op-ed-Three-openings-for-Europe-in-the-global-AI-ecosystem-scaled-1095x616.jpg 1095w" width="1920"> </img></figure>\n<div class="banner_text__title">\n<h1>Careers</h1>\n</div>\n<div class="banner_text__description">\n<p>We seek talented and passionate team players. \u2028Join us if you are committed to making a difference.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="key_takeaways">\n<div class="block_container container_grid">\n<div class="from_4_to_5 content wider">\n<div class="last_no_spacing">\n<h2>Our values</h2>\n<p data-end="557" data-start="225">We’re working to help Europe govern emerging technologies responsibly, with the long-term in mind. That requires not just sharp thinking, but a way of working grounded in shared principles. Our values shape how we collaborate internally, how we engage with our partners, and how we carry out our mission to serve future generations.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="takeaways">\n<div class="takeaway_item">\n<p class="takeaway_item__number">1</p>\n<h4 class="takeaway_item__title">Intellectual humility</h4>\n<p class="takeaway_item__description tag_regular">We work in a fast-moving, complex space. That makes it essential to stay open-minded, curious, and willing to update our views. We aim to challenge our own assumptions, listen carefully, and learn across disciplines. Expertise matters – but so does the ability to say, “we don’t know yet.”</p>\n</div>\n<div class="takeaway_item">\n<p class="takeaway_item__number">2</p>\n<h4 class="takeaway_item__title">Collaboration</h4>\n<p class="takeaway_item__description tag_regular">We believe the best ideas come from working together. Whether we’re working across teams or across borders, we aim to foster a culture of trust and respect. That means sharing credit, valuing each other’s input, and staying focused on collective impact over individual wins.</p>\n</div>\n<div class="takeaway_item">\n<p class="takeaway_item__number">3</p>\n<h4 class="takeaway_item__title">Compassion</h4>\n<p class="takeaway_item__description tag_regular">We’re committed to a workplace culture that’s not only high-performing but also humane. We treat each other and those we work with with empathy, patience, and care. We\'re no strangers to frank discussions and controversial opinions – but we\'ll always seek for ways to bridge differences and build relationships. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="container_grid block_container">\n<div class="careers_block from_3_to_10">\n<h2 class="cat_title">Open positions</h2>\n<div class="vacancies vacancies__container">\n<div><h3 class="custom_coming_soon">We’re sorry, but we don’t have any open vacancies at the moment. The best way to hear about future opportunities is to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/centre-for-future-generations/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">follow us on LinkedIn.</a></h3></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
