f AI for the public good. At Safer AI, you’ll work on high-impact problems alongside experts from diverse backgrounds, with a culture that values rigour, humility, and long-term thinking.</p></div></div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="jobs" id="in99emi36j"> <link href="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/css/jobs.css?ver=1.0.64" rel="stylesheet"/> <div class="container"> <div class="grid" x-data="view"> <div class="col-12-sm"> <div class="t--fadedown">\n<h5>Current Opportunities</h5>\n</div> </div> </div> <div class="grid" x-data="view(true)"> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/policy-associate"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Policy Associate</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is seeking a Policy Associate with a strong ability to engage and coordinate multiple stakeholders, including policymakers and scientists.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://airtable.com/app0AL7POpsq4l0M1/pagnVLt8HvhHCCRuz/form" target="_blank"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">General Expression of Interest</div> <div class="excerpt">                   We are considering hiring both technical and AI governance experts in the near-future. We encourage you to reach out if you\'re enthusiastic about our mission.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<!-- LAYOUT:FOOTER -->\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
