2026-03-30 10:21:17,907 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5e15aa56-3448-48ff-9c51-3f4560e9c862', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://futureoflife.org/our-work/careers/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="ct-div-block" id="main-content"><section class="ct-section owl--s align-items--center text--center" id="section-2-30858"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h1 class="ct-headline width--l text--larger" id="headline-4-30858"><span class="ct-span" id="span-10-30858">Careers</span></h1><div class="ct-text-block width--m text--l" id="text_block-5-30858"><span class="ct-span" id="span-12-30858">Whether at FLI or at a likeminded partner organisation, there are countless ways you can work to improve the direction in which life’s prospects are heading.</span></div></div></section><div class="ct-inner-content" id="inner_content-13-30858"><section class="ct-section pad-section--s" id="section-34-30797"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block grid--auto-2-1 gap--l" id="div_block-402-30797"><div class="ct-div-block order--first-l" id="div_block-40-30797"><img alt="" class="ct-image object-fit--cover rounded--s" id="image-41-30797" sizes="(max-width: 2174px) 100vw, 2174px" src="https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-scaled.jpg" srcset="https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-scaled.jpg 2174w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-300x166.jpg 300w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-1024x565.jpg 1024w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-768x424.jpg 768w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-1536x848.jpg 1536w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/FLI_Miami_Retreat_24-2048x1131.jpg 2048w"/></div><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs bg--white width--l" id="div_block-35-30797"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-36-30797">Our people</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-37-30797">A team committed to the future of life.</h2><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-38-30797">Collectively we represent a diverse range of expertise, having come to the Institute from governance institutions, industry and academia, and a variety of disciplines, including the behavioural sciences, medicine, machine learning, engineering, law and design.</div><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-461-30797">Our team is spread across the globe. Most roles offer home-working options, or you can work from one of our four offices: Campbell in California, Washington DC, Brussels in Belgium or London in the UK</div><a class="ct-link-button btn--primary" href="https://futureoflife.org/about-us/our-people/" id="link_button-39-30797">Our people</a></div></div></div></section><section class="ct-section" id="section-2-30797"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block grid--auto-2-3 gap--xl" id="div_block-404-30797"><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs width--l" id="div_block-3-30797"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-4-30797">Open positions</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-5-30797">Opportunities to join the team</h2><div class="ct-text-block text--l" id="text_block-6-30797">In the past couple of years, The Future of Life Institute has expanded rapidly, and we aim to continue doing so.<br/></div><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-458-30797">If you are aligned with our mission but don\'t see a current open role that suits you, fill out our \'<a href="https://jobs.lever.co/futureof-life/2ad000b8-8c02-49a0-bbea-a588137665db">Rolling applications</a>\' form so we can contact you when one opens.<br/></div><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-455-30797">Keep an eye on this board for open positions suited to your skills and experience. We also advertise our positions in our <a href="https://futureoflife.org/newsletters">newsletter</a> and on our socials: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/future-of-life-institute/posts/?feedView=all">LinkedIn</a>, <a href="https://x.com/FLI_org">X</a></div><div class="ct-text-block text--shade-medium" id="text_block-572-30797">We are represented by 3rd party recruiters, including Heather Albert of Van Brunt Partners. If you have any concerns about potentially fraudulent recruiting outreach, please contact <a href="mailto:jobsadmin@futureoflife.org">jobsadmin@futureoflife.org</a>.<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block bg--shade-ultra-light radius pad--m" id="div_block-7-30797"><div class="ct-code-block width--full" id="code_block-11-30797"><section><div class="container" id="jobs-container"><div class="jobs-list"></div></div></section> </div></div></div></div></section><section class="ct-section owl--xl pad-section--xs" id="section-50-30797"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs width--l" id="div_block-51-30797"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-52-30797">Culture</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-53-30797">What is it like to work with us?</h2><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-54-30797">Here are the main reasons our team members choose to work at The Future of Life Institute:</div></div><div class="ct-div-block grid--auto-2 gap--xl" id="div_block-55-30797"><div class="ct-div-block gap--m" id="div_block-58-30797"><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs" id="div_block-60-30797"><h3 class="ct-headline" id="headline-63-30797">Mission</h3><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-64-30797">We believe there aren’t many things you could be working on that are more important than assuring and improving the future of all life on earth. This mission inspires all of us on the team day by day to do our best work.</div></div><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs" id="div_block-66-30797"><h3 class="ct-headline" id="headline-69-30797">Autonomy</h3><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-70-30797">Every team member has tremendous creative and operational freedom. We can formulate and pursue projects individually, or in sub-teams, so long as cohesion with the full team and its broader mission is maintained.</div></div><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs" id="div_block-76-30797"><h3 class="ct-headline" id="headline-79-30797">Impact</h3><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-80-30797">We are an action-oriented organisation, meaning each of us has the chance to translate our ideas and efforts into tangible results. This can be immensely rewarding.</div></div></div><div class="ct-div-block" id="div_block-59-30797"><img alt="" class="ct-image object-fit--cover aspect--1-1 rounded--s" id="image-81-30797" sizes="(max-width: 1715px) 100vw, 1715px" src="https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2.jpg" srcset="https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2.jpg 1715w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2-300x210.jpg 300w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2-1024x717.jpg 1024w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2-768x537.jpg 768w, https://futureoflife.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/FLI_Website-2-1536x1075.jpg 1536w"/></div></div></div></section><section class="ct-section pad-section--s" id="section-463-30797"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block gap--xs width--l" id="div_block-473-30797"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-471-30797">Our recruitment process</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-472-30797">How we hire people</h2><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-475-30797">We believe FLI\'s impact is down to the strength of our team, therefore we invest time to find exceptional talent. Depending on the role and who applies, the recruitment process may look a little different. Generally it includes the following stages:<br/></div><div class="ct-div-block gap--xs" id="div_block-476-30797"><div class="ct-div-block flex--row gap--s" id="div_block-477-30797"><div class="ct-text-block text--600 text--primary-medium bg--primary-ultra-light radius--xs text--l justify-content--center" id="text_block-478-30797">1.</div><div class="ct-text-block text--l" id="text_block-479-30797">Submit an application through our application form.<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block flex--row gap--s" id="div_block-480-30797"><div class="ct-text-block text--600 text--primary-medium bg--primary-ultra-light radius--xs text--l justify-content--center" id="text_block-481-30797">2.</div><div class="ct-text-block text--l" id="text_block-482-30797">Complete one or two short, paid work test designed to simulate the work that will be performed in this role.<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block flex--row gap--s" id="div_block-483-30797"><div class="ct-text-block text--600 text--primary-medium bg--primary-ultra-light radius--xs text--l justify-content--center" id="text_block-484-30797">3.</div><div class="ct-text-block text--l" id="text_block-485-30797">Panel interviews with several members of staff across FLI.<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block flex--row gap--s" id="div_block-486-30797"><div class="ct-text-block text--600 text--primary-medium bg--primary-ultra-light radius--xs text--l justify-content--center" id="text_block-487-30797">4.</div><div class="ct-text-block text--l" id="text_block-488-30797">Reference checks.<br/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ct-section pad-section--s" id="section-490-30797"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block gap--xs width--full" id="div_block-491-30797"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-492-30797">Benefits</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-493-30797">What do we offer our team members?</h2><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-494-30797">The exact benefits we offer depend on a team member\'s location, but for US employees we offer:<br/></div><div class="ct-div-block grid--auto-4" id="div_block-508-30797"><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-509-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-510-30797">Competitive salaries benchmarked against other US Foundations<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-517-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-518-30797">4 months of fully paid parental leave<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-521-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-522-30797">A work from home allowance for the purchase of equipment and office supplies<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-519-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-520-30797">A learning and development allowance<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-515-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-516-30797">24+ days of paid time off a year<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-511-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-512-30797">401k pension matching<br/></div></div><div class="ct-div-block careers-benefit-box" id="div_block-513-30797"><div class="ct-text-block careers-benefit-text" id="text_block-514-30797">Health insurance<br/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="ct-section" id="section-12-30891"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div class="ct-div-block gap--xxl grid--auto-2" id="div_block-41-30904"><div class="ct-div-block owl--xs width--l" id="div_block-13-30891"><h1 class="ct-headline text--section-hint" id="headline-14-30891">Contact us</h1><h2 class="ct-headline" id="headline-15-30891">Let\'s put you in touch with the right person.</h2><div class="ct-text-block" id="text_block-16-30891">We do our best to respond to all incoming queries within three business days. Our team is spread across the globe, so please be considerate and remember that the person you are contacting may not be in your timezone.</div><div class="ct-text-block bg--primary-ultra-light text--primary-dark rounded--s pad--s" id="text_block-40-30904">Please direct media requests and speaking invitations for Max Tegmark to <a href="mailto:press@futureoflife.org">press@futureoflife.org</a>. All other inquiries can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@futureoflife.org">contact@futureoflife.org</a>.</div></div><div class="ct-div-block gap--m" id="div_block-17-30891"><div class="ct-div-block pad--m rounded--s width--full border--thin-shade-light owl--s" id="div_block-32-30904"><div class="ct-div-block text--m" id="div_block-39-30904"><h4 class="ct-headline profile--meta-text" id="headline-33-30904">General inquiries</h4><a class="ct-link-text" href="mailto:contact@futureoflife.org" id="link_text-34-30904" target="_self">contact@futureoflife.org</a></div><div class="ct-div-block text--m" id="div_block-20-30891"><h4 class="ct-headline profile--meta-text" id="headline-21-30891">Policy</h4><a class="ct-link-text" href="mailto:policy@futureoflife.org" id="link_text-22-30891" target="_self">policy@futureoflife.org</a></div><div class="ct-div-block text--m" id="div_block-28-30891"><h4 class="ct-headline profile--meta-text" id="headline-29-30891">Futures</h4><a class="ct-link-text" href="mailto:futures@futureoflife.org" id="link_text-30-30891" target="_self">futures@futureoflife.org</a></div><div class="ct-div-block text--m" id="div_block-35-30904"><h4 class="ct-headline profile--meta-text" id="headline-36-30904">Grants</h4><a class="ct-link-text" href="mailto:grants@futureoflife.org" id="link_text-37-30904" target="_self">grants@futureoflife.org</a></div><div class="ct-div-block text--m" id="div_block-31-30891"><h4 class="ct-headline profile--meta-text" id="headline-32-30891">Press</h4><a class="ct-link-text" href="mailto:press@futureoflife.org" id="link_text-33-30891" target="_self">press@futureoflife.org</a></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
