azy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33b08f49fb5ee91687_584d03b1fc431c846cd06f6237351573_Gray%20Swan%3DDark%20Horizontal.svg"/></div></a></div></div></div><div class="navigation-mob w-nav" data-animation="over-right" data-collapse="medium" data-doc-height="1" data-duration="400" data-easing="ease-out" data-easing2="ease-out" role="banner"><div class="navigation-container-mob"><a class="navigation-logo-container w-nav-brand" href="/"><div class="logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="brand-logotype" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33ca0b8f284d3b3b40_ca18847e7b3f6e2e7038dac7bd3846ce_Gray%20Swan%3DWhite%20Horizontal.svg"/><img alt="" class="brand-logotype is-positive" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/66886e33b08f49fb5ee91687_584d03b1fc431c846cd06f6237351573_Gray%20Swan%3DDark%20Horizontal.svg"/></div></a><div class="navigation-menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="w-embed"></div></div></div></div></div><section class="header interior"><div class="padding-global z-2"><div class="container-large"><div class="hero-text-wrapper"><div class="breadcrumb neg-margin"><a aria-current="page" class="text-link-background w-inline-block w--current" href="/careers"><div class="all-caps t-c-white">Careers</div></a></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><h1 class="hero-text" data-w-id="9f32cf13-2f33-7f82-70a9-b7596f3203a5" style="opacity:0">Making AI Safe to Ship</h1><div><div class="padding-sm"></div><p class="t-c-white text-size-md" data-w-id="15650e45-56be-0233-742c-2c884daa3f30" style="opacity:0">Real stakes. Real-world impact.</p><div class="padding-sm"></div></div><div class="button-wrapper portrait-full"><a class="button is-yellow w-inline-block" href="#open-positions"><div>View open positions</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Model Metrics</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Pricing</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="background-fill overlay"></div><div class="hero-on-load"><div class="hero-vector w-embed">\n</div></div></section><section class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5a3-88911a7d"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium">The Hardest Problems Emerge at the Edge of AI</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>The most interesting, and messiest, problems show up at the edges.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="padding-md hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ab" style="opacity:0"><div class="padding-lg hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ad" style="opacity:0"></div><p>Gray Swan has made a habit of being first in line. We’re often the first to spot new failure modes, and, by extension, the first to defend against them. Being research-first isn’t a tagline. It’s how we build our products, our playbooks, and our culture of thinking three steps ahead.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><p>Whether it’s stress-testing the latest agentic AI in a lab or helping enterprises deploy at full speed, our goal is the same: uncover the hard problems before anyone else does, then turn that insight into real-world solutions that let innovation happen, safely and without slowing down.</p></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5c8" style="opacity:0"><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5ca" style="opacity:0"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper hide-tablet" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5e5" style="opacity:0"><div class="padding-md"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a5e7" style="opacity:0"></div></div><div class="left-border-card-wrapper" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a605" style="opacity:0"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="border-left" data-w-id="298f13e8-e836-0855-7563-56cbfb54a607" style="opacity:0"></div></div></div></div><div class="hr-200 is-heavy"></div></div></section><section><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Trusted at the Frontier</h2><p>Our research has directly informed the safety evaluations of some of the most advanced AI models in the world.</p></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><div><div class="w-layout-grid _3-up-grid"><div class="column card" data-w-id="a129df2c-594c-72b0-9fca-0c7156de53d2" style="opacity:0"><img alt="OpenAI logo image\n" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/698515134766095765b88006_OpenAI_Logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">o1</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.openai.com/o1-system-card-20241205.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div><div class="column card" data-w-id="711d877c-0c6c-584b-296b-50f5aff75670" style="opacity:0"><img alt="OpenAI logo image\n" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/698515134766095765b88006_OpenAI_Logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">o3 mini</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://cdn.openai.com/o3-mini-system-card-feb10.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div><div class="column card" data-w-id="c7e2dde2-85d9-50bf-7de7-06cfd7b05ffc" style="opacity:0"><img alt="OpenAI logo image\n" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/698515134766095765b88006_OpenAI_Logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">GPT 5</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2601.03267" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div><div class="column card" data-w-id="a626f5f9-f173-f487-20fe-059689a18f0f" style="opacity:0"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/6985167e2b412cd76f981b26_Anthropic_logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">Opus 4.6</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/c788cbc0a3da9135112f97cdf6dcd06f2c16cee2.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div><div class="column card" data-w-id="c79bc34a-7a71-cbcb-f7ed-b44c06392568" style="opacity:0"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/6985167e2b412cd76f981b26_Anthropic_logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">Haiku 4.5</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/7aad69bf12627d42234e01ee7c36305dc2f6a970.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div><div class="column card" data-w-id="dd0502f1-553d-f2d0-d16c-7573bebd931b" style="opacity:0"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2b7/6985167e2b412cd76f981b26_Anthropic_logo.svg"/><h3 class="heading-small align-center">Sonnet 4.6</h3><a class="button is-small is-white w-inline-block" href="https://www-cdn.anthropic.com/78073f739564e986ff3e28522761a7a0b4484f84.pdf" target="_blank"><div>View the Model Card</div></a></div></div></div><div class="padding-lg"></div></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div></section><section><section class="section bg-c-gray900" id="products"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_4a238c86-b46a-72f1-855b-50e83107cb49-88911a7d"><div class="padding-xl"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium t-c-white">Small Team. Outsized Impact.</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><div><p class="t-c-white">As a Swan, individual work matters, immediately.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="button-wrapper portrait-full"><a class="button is-yellow w-inline-block" href="#open-positions"><div>View open positions</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Model Metrics</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Pricing</div></a></div></div><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper full-height" data-w-id="4a238c86-b46a-72f1-855b-50e83107cb54" style="opacity:0"><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left is-yellow" data-w-id="4a238c86-b46a-72f1-855b-50e83107cb56" style="opacity:0"></div><div class="rtf-white w-richtext"><p>Your work helps shape how AI is deployed, evaluated, and trusted; from enterprises shipping to production, to researchers pushing new capabilities, to organizations responsible for safety at scale.</p></div><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="rtf-white w-richtext"><p>This is work with real consequences. Looking for a place where your thinking carries weight and where progress is measured in outcomes, not meetings? <strong>You’ll find it here.</strong></p></div><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_096ccd17-9373-8cda-aef6-e666105c0ac3-88911a7d"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Support That Lets You Do Your Best Work</h2><p>Our benefits are designed to support real life, sustained curiosity, and the kind of deep work that meaningful impact requires.</p></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-sm"><div class="_2x-grid landscape"><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>28 days off between holidays &amp;\xa0PTO:\xa0</strong>Time off that actually feels like time off.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>401(k) with up to 4% matching: </strong>We invest in the long term; yours included.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Flexible work arrangements: </strong>We care about outcomes, not where your laptop happens to be.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Professional development support: </strong>Learning isn’t optional here. We make room for it.</li></ul></div><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>Medical, dental, and vision coverage: </strong>Comprehensive coverage, because your health isn’t a side project.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Catered lunches (Pittsburgh office): </strong>Good food, fewer decisions, better afternoons.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Visa sponsorship</strong>:<strong> </strong>Great work knows no borders. We’ll help with the paperwork.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Short-term disability &amp; parental support: </strong>100% paid, including parental leave, with up to 14 weeks of paid birthing leave. So you can focus on what matters most.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-lg"></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div></section><section id="open-positions"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_4b80b22b-42ff-875c-a016-a3c601446255-88911a7d"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Do the Work That Matters</h2><p>If you’re excited by meaningful problems, real responsibility, and work that shows up in the world, you’ll fit right in. Take a look at our open roles below.</p></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-sm"><div class="w-embed"><div id="ashby_embed"></div></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-lg"></div></div><div class="hr-200"></div></section><div class="hr-200"></div><section class="overflow-hidden" id="joinNewsletter"><div class="padding-global relative"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="div-block-89"><div class="large-brand-background-art w-embed"></div><div class="div-block-90"><h2 class="heading-medium">Don’t see the role you’re looking for?</h2><div class="padding-xxs"></div><p class="textwrap-balance">Join our Talent Newsletter and get notified about new roles.</p></div><div class="form-div"><div><div class="w-embed w-script">\n</div></div></div></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div></div></section><div class="w-embed w-script"></div></body>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
